; `:offset` phases a PERIODIC schedule, so it is meaningless beside an
; explicit `:at` list. `:requires [every]` in the manifest turns what
; used to be a silent no-op ("ignored without :every") into a
; source=sjon 'PACD' record with a span on the offending key.
(transport :bpm 120)

(trigger :target radius :at [4b 8b] :offset 1b)
